{"place":"works-danjiang","num":79,"row":["works-danjiang",25.175534,121.417847,"淡江大橋","Danjiang Bridge","TW","新北市","infrastructure","淡江大橋跨越淡水河口，連接淡水與八里，2026 年 5 月 12 日通車；主橋 920 公尺，單一橋塔高 211 公尺，主跨 450 公尺，是全球最長的單塔不對稱斜張橋。","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Danjiang_Bridge",0,"淡江大桥",""],"name":{"zh-Hant":"淡江大橋","en":"Danjiang Bridge","zh-Hans":"淡江大桥"},"center":[25.175534,121.417847],"airspace":{"zh":"在台灣飛行無人機須依民航局規定，並以「遙控無人機管理資訊系統」查詢禁限航區；淡水河口鄰近航道與管制區域，請行前查詢；本片為電腦擬真畫面，非實地空拍。","en":"Drones in Taiwan follow CAA rules; check no-fly and restricted zones in the CAA drone system; check the river-mouth area before flying. This film is simulated, not real drone footage.","src":"https://drone.caa.gov.tw/"},"pois":{"pylon":{"zh":"淡江大橋主塔","en":"Danjiang Bridge pylon","lat":25.175534,"lon":121.417847,"note":"single pylon, 211 m","src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-tw/淡江大橋","h":200},"deck":{"zh":"主跨中段","en":"Middle of the main span","lat":25.173515,"lon":121.417361,"note":"the 450 m main span toward Bali","src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Danjiang_Bridge","h":30},"back":{"zh":"淡水側背跨","en":"Back span, Tamsui side","lat":25.176331,"lon":121.417995,"note":"the 175 m back span toward Tamsui","src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Danjiang_Bridge","h":30},"bali":{"zh":"八里端","en":"Bali end","lat":25.170119,"lon":121.416545,"note":"south end of the main bridge","src":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/574378102","h":28},"tamsui":{"zh":"淡水端","en":"Tamsui end","lat":25.178264,"lon":121.418356,"note":"north end of the main bridge","src":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/574378102","h":28},"approach":{"zh":"八里引道","en":"Bali approach","lat":25.166946,"lon":121.413631,"note":"the approach viaduct on the Bali side","src":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/574378102","h":12},"links":{"zh":"淡水側匝道","en":"Tamsui links","lat":25.179163,"lon":121.419388,"note":"the ramps down into Tamsui","src":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/574378102","h":15},"mouth":{"zh":"淡水河口","en":"Mouth of the Tamsui River","lat":25.1795,"lon":121.4025,"note":"where the river meets the Taiwan Strait (approximate)","src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Danjiang_Bridge"},"wharf":{"zh":"漁人碼頭","en":"Fisherman's Wharf","lat":25.18387,"lon":121.41118,"note":"north bank of the river mouth","src":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright"},"guanyin":{"zh":"觀音山","en":"Guanyin Mountain","lat":25.13594,"lon":121.42668,"note":"616 m","src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-tw/觀音山_(新北市)","h":300},"guandu":{"zh":"關渡大橋","en":"Guandu Bridge","lat":25.1185,"lon":121.4605,"note":"the old crossing upstream (approximate)","src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-tw/關渡大橋"}},"photos":[],"tours":[{"id":"works-overview","theme":"works-overview","title":{"zh-Hant":"淡江大橋：工程概要","en":"Danjiang Bridge: Overview"},"tagline":{"zh-Hant":"一座塔撐起 450 公尺的主跨，連起淡水與八里","en":"One pylon, a 450 m main span, and Tamsui joined to Bali"},"time":"2026-11-08 08:40","weather":"clear","season":"autumn","shots":[{"dur":30,"move":"reveal","at":"deck","weather":"few","alt":520,"dist0":3200,"dist":1900,"from":300,"arc":16,"pitch":-12,"zh":["淡水河口，淡江大橋連接北岸的淡水與南岸的八里。","2026 年 5 月 12 日通車，主橋全長 920 公尺。"],"en":["At the Tamsui River mouth, the Danjiang Bridge links Tamsui on the north bank with Bali.","It opened on 12 May 2026; the main bridge is 920 m long."],"time":"2026-11-08 08:40","time1":"08:44","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":28,"move":"orbit","at":"pylon","alt":260,"dist":560,"from":60,"arc":70,"pitch":-8,"zh":["只有一座橋塔，高 211 公尺。","主跨 450 公尺，是全世界最長的單塔不對稱斜張橋。"],"en":["It has a single pylon, 211 m tall.","Its 450 m main span is the longest of any single-pylon asymmetric cable-stayed bridge."],"time":"2026-11-08 08:50","time1":"08:54","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":27,"move":"track","at":"deck","alt":160,"dist":700,"from":100,"arc":-50,"pitch":-8,"zh":["橋塔不在河中央，而是偏向淡水一側。","主跨伸向八里，背跨 175 公尺留在淡水這邊。"],"en":["The pylon is not in mid-river but off to the Tamsui side.","The main span reaches toward Bali; a 175 m back span stays on the Tamsui side."],"time":"2026-11-08 09:00","time1":"09:04","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":27,"move":"topdown","at":"pylon","alt":420,"from":11,"arc":10,"zh":["從正上方看，兩組車道在橋塔前分開，從兩側繞過。","橋面寬 44 公尺，在橋塔處加寬到 71 公尺。"],"en":["From straight above, the two carriageways part in front of the pylon and pass on either side.","The deck is 44 m wide and widens to 71 m at the pylon."],"time":"2026-11-08 09:10","time1":"09:14","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":25,"move":"push","at":"tamsui","alt":70,"dist0":1400,"dist":520,"from":196,"pitch":-4,"zh":["車道、機車道、自行車道與人行道都在同一座橋上。","中央預留輕軌路廊，通車初期先作為公車專用道。"],"en":["Car lanes, motorcycle lanes, a cycle path and footpaths share the one deck.","A corridor in the middle is kept for light rail; for now it is a bus lane."],"time":"2026-11-08 09:20","time1":"09:24","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":27,"move":"orbit","at":"approach","alt":180,"dist":760,"from":150,"arc":50,"pitch":-10,"zh":["八里這一端，引道高架從河岸慢慢降回地面。","接上台 64 線與西濱快速公路，往三重、板橋與桃園機場。"],"en":["At the Bali end the approach viaduct slopes gently back down to the ground.","It joins Route 64 and the West Coast Expressway toward Sanchong, Banqiao and Taoyuan Airport."],"time":"2026-11-08 09:30","time1":"09:34","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":25,"move":"orbit","at":"links","alt":150,"dist":600,"from":20,"arc":-45,"pitch":-12,"zh":["淡水這一端，匝道分成兩支，彎進市區的道路。","過去要到對岸，得搭渡輪或繞到上游的關渡大橋。"],"en":["At the Tamsui end the ramps split in two and curve down into the town.","Before the bridge, crossing meant a ferry or a detour upstream to the Guandu Bridge."],"time":"2026-11-08 09:40","time1":"09:44","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":25,"move":"pull","at":"pylon","alt":330,"dist0":700,"dist":2300,"from":70,"pitch":-8,"zh":["橋位就在河口，旁邊是漁人碼頭與台灣海峽。","設計時刻意保留從淡水看出去的夕陽景觀。"],"en":["The bridge sits right at the river mouth, beside Fisherman's Wharf and the Taiwan Strait.","The design deliberately kept the famous view of the sunset from Tamsui."],"time":"2026-11-08 09:50","time1":"09:54","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":29,"move":"flyover","at":"tamsui","to":"bali","alt":95,"pitch":-12,"zh":["沿著橋面從淡水飛向八里。","主跨下方沒有任何橋墩，河口的船隻可以通行。"],"en":["Flying along the deck from Tamsui toward Bali.","There are no piers under the main span, leaving the river mouth open to boats."],"time":"2026-11-08 10:00","time1":"10:04","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":25,"move":"orbit","at":"guanyin","alt":650,"dist":3600,"from":340,"arc":30,"pitch":-6,"zh":["南岸的觀音山海拔 616 公尺，是河口的地標。","大橋、山與海，構成新的淡水河口天際線。"],"en":["Guanyin Mountain on the south bank, 616 m high, is the landmark of the river mouth.","Bridge, mountain and sea make a new skyline at the mouth of the Tamsui."],"time":"2026-11-08 10:10","time1":"10:14","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":32,"move":"orbit","at":"pylon","alt":420,"dist":1500,"from":250,"arc":40,"pitch":-10,"zh":["接下來的三部影片，","分別看它的結構、興建過程與通車後的影響。","本片為電腦擬真重建：結構依公開資料簡化建模，","地形取自公開高程資料，不是實地空拍畫面。"],"en":["The next three films look at","its structure, how it was built, and what it changed.","A computer reconstruction: the structures are simplified models built from public data,","and the terrain comes from public elevation data. This is not real drone footage."],"time":"2026-11-08 10:20","time1":"10:25","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}}]},{"id":"works-structure","theme":"works-structure","title":{"zh-Hant":"淡江大橋：結構與技術","en":"Danjiang Bridge: Structure"},"tagline":{"zh-Hant":"單塔不對稱斜張橋怎麼站得住","en":"How a single-pylon asymmetric cable-stayed bridge stands up"},"time":"2026-11-08 13:30","weather":"clear","season":"autumn","shots":[{"dur":27,"move":"orbit","at":"pylon","weather":"few","alt":150,"dist":430,"from":120,"arc":60,"pitch":-4,"zh":["淡江大橋是斜張橋：橋面由鋼索拉住，","鋼索再把力量傳到橋塔，往下送進基礎。"],"en":["The Danjiang Bridge is a cable-stayed bridge: stay cables hold up the deck","and carry its weight to the pylon and down into the foundations."],"time":"2026-11-08 13:30","time1":"13:34","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":29,"move":"rise","at":"pylon","alt0":30,"alt":230,"dist":300,"from":285,"arc":20,"pitch":0,"zh":["橋塔由兩支斜腳組成，順著橋軸方向張開，","在高處合而為一，再往上收成塔尖。"],"en":["The pylon is made of two leaning legs that spread out along the line of the bridge","and join high up, then narrow into a spire."],"time":"2026-11-08 13:40","time1":"13:44","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":27,"move":"orbit","at":"pylon","alt":120,"dist":260,"from":190,"arc":-40,"pitch":2,"zh":["鋼索排成兩個面，從塔頂附近拉到橋面兩側。","單一橋塔撐起兩邊不等長的橋面，所以稱為「不對稱」。"],"en":["The cables form two planes, running from near the top to both edges of the deck.","One pylon holds spans of unequal length on either side, so the bridge is called asymmetric."],"time":"2026-11-08 13:50","time1":"13:54","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":27,"move":"track","at":"deck","alt":90,"dist":420,"from":280,"arc":50,"pitch":-4,"zh":["主跨 450 公尺伸向八里，這一側的鋼索最多也最長。","另一側背跨較短，鋼索把塔往回拉，與主跨取得平衡。"],"en":["The 450 m main span reaches toward Bali, with the most and the longest cables.","On the short back span the cables pull the pylon back and balance the main span."],"time":"2026-11-08 14:00","time1":"14:04","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":25,"move":"topdown","at":"deck","alt":300,"from":11,"arc":-8,"zh":["橋面寬 44 公尺，斷面寬而扁，有助於抵抗河口的強風。","車道、輕軌路廊與 5 公尺寬的人行及自行車道並排。"],"en":["The deck is 44 m wide; its broad, flat section helps it stand up to the strong river-mouth wind.","Lanes, the rail corridor and a 5 m path for walkers and cyclists sit side by side."],"time":"2026-11-08 14:10","time1":"14:14","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":27,"move":"push","at":"pylon","alt":48,"dist0":520,"dist":150,"from":196,"pitch":-6,"zh":["橋塔處橋面加寬到 71 公尺：","兩組車道從塔的兩側繞過，中間留給塔腳。"],"en":["At the pylon the deck widens to 71 m:","the carriageways pass on either side and leave the middle to the pylon legs."],"time":"2026-11-08 14:20","time1":"14:24","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":25,"move":"orbit","at":"bali","alt":90,"dist":380,"from":120,"arc":60,"pitch":-8,"zh":["八里端是主跨的終點，","橋面在這裡接上引道高架，改由一般橋墩支撐。"],"en":["The Bali end is where the main span finishes;","there the deck joins the approach viaduct and ordinary piers take over."],"time":"2026-11-08 14:30","time1":"14:34","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":27,"move":"orbit","at":"approach","alt":60,"dist":420,"from":200,"arc":-40,"pitch":-6,"zh":["引道橋墩每隔數十公尺一座，","把橋面從 28 公尺左右的高度一路降回地面。"],"en":["On the approach the piers stand every few dozen metres,","bringing the deck down from about 28 m to the ground."],"time":"2026-11-08 14:40","time1":"14:44","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":29,"move":"orbit","at":"pylon","alt":300,"dist":900,"from":330,"arc":40,"pitch":-8,"zh":["河口風大，又位在地震帶上，","結構以抗風與耐震為設計重點。","模型中的橋面高度與引道坡度為估計值。"],"en":["The river mouth is windy and Taiwan lies on an earthquake belt,","so wind and earthquakes shaped the design.","In this model the deck height and approach gradients are estimates."],"time":"2026-11-08 14:50","time1":"14:55","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":25,"move":"pull","at":"deck","alt":240,"dist0":600,"dist":1800,"from":60,"pitch":-8,"zh":["橋梁的造型由札哈·哈蒂建築師事務所設計，","結構工程則由中興工程顧問負責。"],"en":["The form of the bridge was designed by Zaha Hadid Architects,","with Sinotech Engineering Consultants responsible for the engineering."],"time":"2026-11-08 15:00","time1":"15:04","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":32,"move":"orbit","at":"pylon","alt":210,"dist":700,"from":230,"arc":45,"pitch":-6,"zh":["一座塔、兩面索、一條寬扁的橋面，","就是淡江大橋結構的全部重點。","本片為電腦擬真重建：結構依公開資料簡化建模，","地形取自公開高程資料，不是實地空拍畫面。"],"en":["One pylon, two planes of cables and one broad, flat deck:","that is the whole structure of the Danjiang Bridge.","A computer reconstruction: the structures are simplified models built from public data,","and the terrain comes from public elevation data. This is not real drone footage."],"time":"2026-11-08 15:10","time1":"15:15","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}}]},{"id":"works-build","theme":"works-build","title":{"zh-Hant":"淡江大橋：施工歷程","en":"Danjiang Bridge: Construction"},"tagline":{"zh-Hant":"從三十多年的構想，到懸臂工法與合龍","en":"Thirty years of plans, balanced cantilevers and the closure"},"time":"2026-11-09 07:30","weather":"clear","season":"autumn","shots":[{"dur":27,"move":"reveal","at":"pylon","weather":"few","alt":380,"dist0":2600,"dist":1500,"from":300,"pitch":-10,"works":{"hide":["pylon","stays","deckB","deckT","approach","traffic"]},"zh":["在大橋出現之前，這裡只有河口與兩岸。","過河要搭渡輪，或繞到上游的關渡大橋。"],"en":["Before the bridge there was only the river mouth and its two banks.","To cross, people took a ferry or went round by the Guandu Bridge upstream."],"time":"2026-11-09 07:30","time1":"07:34","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.2,"base":2000},"grade":{"warm":0.6,"sat":1.1,"contrast":1.06}}},{"dur":25,"move":"pull","at":"guandu","alt":420,"dist0":900,"dist":2600,"from":330,"pitch":-10,"works":{"hide":["pylon","stays","deckB","deckT","approach","traffic"]},"zh":["跨越淡水河口的構想，","從 1980 年代末就開始討論，經過三十多年才實現。"],"en":["The idea of a crossing at the river mouth","was first discussed in the late 1980s and took more than thirty years to come true."],"time":"2026-11-09 07:40","time1":"07:44","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.2,"base":2000},"grade":{"warm":0.6,"sat":1.1,"contrast":1.06}}},{"dur":29,"move":"rise","at":"pylon","alt0":60,"alt":200,"dist":520,"from":110,"arc":30,"pitch":-2,"works":{"hide":["stays","deckB","deckT","approach","traffic"],"rise":{"pylon":[0,215]}},"zh":["主橋 2019 年動工，先打基礎，再一節一節往上蓋橋塔。","畫面示意橋塔由下往上長高。"],"en":["Work on the main bridge began in 2019: foundations first, then the pylon, section by section.","Here the pylon is shown rising from the bottom up."],"time":"2026-11-09 07:50","time1":"07:55","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.2,"base":2000},"grade":{"warm":0.6,"sat":1.1,"contrast":1.06}}},{"dur":27,"move":"orbit","at":"pylon","alt":140,"dist":520,"from":200,"arc":40,"pitch":-4,"works":{"hide":["approach","traffic"],"show":{"deckB":[0,0.3],"deckT":[0,0.45],"stays":[0,0.3]}},"zh":["橋塔完成後，橋面從塔的兩側同時往外伸出，","這種做法叫做「懸臂工法」。"],"en":["With the pylon finished, the deck grew outward from both sides of it at once.","This is called balanced cantilever erection."],"time":"2026-11-09 08:00","time1":"08:04","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.2,"base":2000},"grade":{"warm":0.6,"sat":1.1,"contrast":1.06}}},{"dur":27,"move":"track","at":"deck","alt":110,"dist":520,"from":110,"arc":-40,"pitch":-4,"works":{"hide":["approach","traffic"],"show":{"deckB":[0.3,0.75],"deckT":[0.45,1],"stays":[0.3,0.75]}},"zh":["橋面節塊在工廠預製，從台北港以船運到橋下，再一段段吊裝。","每接上一段，就裝上鋼索把它拉住，鋼索也越拉越遠。"],"en":["Deck segments were made in advance, shipped from Taipei Port and lifted into place one by one.","Each new segment was held by new cables, reaching farther out as the deck grew."],"time":"2026-11-09 08:10","time1":"08:14","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.2,"base":2000},"grade":{"warm":0.6,"sat":1.1,"contrast":1.06}}},{"dur":27,"move":"orbit","at":"bali","alt":150,"dist":600,"from":160,"arc":40,"pitch":-8,"works":{"hide":["traffic"],"show":{"deckB":[0.75,0.92],"stays":[0.75,0.92],"approach":[0.2,1]}},"zh":["另一頭，八里與淡水的引道高架也同步施工，","等著和主橋接在一起。"],"en":["Meanwhile the approach viaducts on the Bali and Tamsui sides were built too,","ready to be joined to the main bridge."],"time":"2026-11-09 08:20","time1":"08:24","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.2,"base":2000},"grade":{"warm":0.6,"sat":1.1,"contrast":1.06}}},{"dur":29,"move":"push","at":"bali","alt":70,"dist0":700,"dist":260,"from":80,"pitch":-6,"works":{"hide":["traffic"],"show":{"deckB":[0.92,1],"stays":[0.92,1]}},"zh":["2025 年 9 月 16 日，主跨最後一段在八里端接上：合龍。","從這一刻起，淡水與八里第一次由橋面相連。"],"en":["On 16 September 2025 the last segment of the main span met the Bali end: the closure.","From that moment Tamsui and Bali were joined by a deck for the first time."],"time":"2026-11-09 08:30","time1":"08:35","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.2,"base":2000},"grade":{"warm":0.6,"sat":1.1,"contrast":1.06}}},{"dur":27,"move":"orbit","at":"pylon","alt":200,"dist":700,"from":240,"arc":50,"pitch":-8,"works":{"hide":["traffic"]},"zh":["接著鋪設路面、護欄、照明與交通設施，","再進行載重試驗，確認結構安全。"],"en":["Then came the road surface, barriers, lighting and traffic equipment,","and load tests to confirm the structure was safe."],"time":"2026-11-09 08:40","time1":"08:44","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.2,"base":2000},"grade":{"warm":0.6,"sat":1.1,"contrast":1.06}}},{"dur":25,"move":"orbit","at":"deck","alt":160,"dist":700,"from":60,"arc":40,"pitch":-8,"zh":["2026 年 5 月 12 日，大橋正式通車。","這是札哈·哈蒂生前參與、最後完成的作品之一。"],"en":["On 12 May 2026 the bridge opened to traffic.","It is one of the last projects Zaha Hadid took part in before her death in 2016."],"time":"2026-11-09 08:50","time1":"08:54","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.2,"base":2000},"grade":{"warm":0.6,"sat":1.1,"contrast":1.06}}},{"dur":25,"move":"pull","at":"tamsui","alt":150,"dist0":400,"dist":1200,"from":20,"pitch":-8,"zh":["通車後仍有後續課題：","機車道寬度、欄杆與部分附屬工程，持續檢討改善。"],"en":["Some questions remained after opening:","the width of the motorcycle lanes, the railings and some finishing works are still being reviewed."],"time":"2026-11-09 09:00","time1":"09:04","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.2,"base":2000},"grade":{"warm":0.6,"sat":1.1,"contrast":1.06}}},{"dur":32,"move":"orbit","at":"pylon","alt":380,"dist":1500,"from":300,"arc":40,"pitch":-10,"zh":["從構想到通車花了三十多年，主橋施工約七年，","總經費約新台幣 230 億元。","本片為電腦擬真重建：結構依公開資料簡化建模，","地形取自公開高程資料，不是實地空拍畫面。"],"en":["From the first idea to opening day took more than thirty years, the main bridge about seven,","at a total cost of about NT$23 billion.","A computer reconstruction: the structures are simplified models built from public data,","and the terrain comes from public elevation data. This is not real drone footage."],"time":"2026-11-09 09:10","time1":"09:15","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.2,"base":2000},"grade":{"warm":0.6,"sat":1.1,"contrast":1.06}}}]},{"id":"works-impact","theme":"works-impact","title":{"zh-Hant":"淡江大橋：功能與影響","en":"Danjiang Bridge: Use and Impact"},"tagline":{"zh-Hant":"河口兩岸的距離與生活，從此不同","en":"How the bridge changed life on both banks of the river mouth"},"time":"2026-11-09 15:30","weather":"clear","season":"autumn","shots":[{"dur":27,"move":"reveal","at":"deck","weather":"few","alt":300,"dist0":2400,"dist":1100,"from":140,"pitch":-10,"zh":["大橋通車後，淡水與八里之間的車程大幅縮短。","以往要繞到關渡大橋，約多出 15 公里。"],"en":["Since the bridge opened, the drive between Tamsui and Bali has become far shorter.","Before, the detour by the Guandu Bridge added about 15 km."],"time":"2026-11-09 15:30","time1":"15:34","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":27,"move":"pull","at":"guandu","alt":380,"dist0":900,"dist":2600,"from":200,"pitch":-10,"zh":["關渡大橋位在上游，","過去是兩岸之間最近的橋，經常塞車。"],"en":["The Guandu Bridge stands upstream;","it used to be the nearest bridge between the two banks and was often jammed."],"time":"2026-11-09 15:40","time1":"15:44","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":27,"move":"track","at":"deck","alt":70,"dist":300,"from":100,"arc":-40,"pitch":-4,"zh":["淡江大橋分擔關渡大橋的車流，","估計約二十萬居民的通勤因此受惠。"],"en":["The Danjiang Bridge takes traffic off the Guandu Bridge;","an estimated 200,000 residents benefit in their daily journeys."],"time":"2026-11-09 15:50","time1":"15:54","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":27,"move":"orbit","at":"approach","alt":200,"dist":900,"from":170,"arc":40,"pitch":-10,"zh":["八里這一端接上台 64 線與西濱快速公路，","淡水往板橋、新店與桃園機場，多了一條快捷的路。"],"en":["On the Bali side it connects to Route 64 and the West Coast Expressway,","giving Tamsui a quicker way to Banqiao, Xindian and Taoyuan Airport."],"time":"2026-11-09 16:00","time1":"16:04","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":25,"move":"push","at":"tamsui","alt":80,"dist0":1100,"dist":450,"from":200,"pitch":-5,"zh":["救護車與消防車也能避開市區壅塞，","更快把病患送到對岸的醫院。"],"en":["Ambulances and fire engines can avoid the town's congestion","and get patients to hospitals across the river faster."],"time":"2026-11-09 16:10","time1":"16:14","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":27,"move":"orbit","at":"pylon","alt":60,"dist":260,"from":150,"arc":50,"pitch":-3,"zh":["中央的路廊預留給淡海輕軌延伸到八里，","目前先讓公車使用。"],"en":["The middle corridor is kept for extending the Danhai Light Rail to Bali;","for now buses use it."],"time":"2026-11-09 16:20","time1":"16:24","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":27,"move":"orbit","at":"mouth","alt":380,"dist":2000,"from":260,"arc":30,"pitch":-8,"zh":["通車也帶來新的課題：","八里有居民反映，冬季東北季風吹過時聽到低頻噪音。"],"en":["Opening also brought new questions:","some Bali residents report low-frequency noise when the winter monsoon blows."],"time":"2026-11-09 16:30","time1":"16:34","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.15,"base":2400},"grade":{"warm":0.9,"sat":1.14,"contrast":1.07}}},{"dur":27,"move":"track","at":"wharf","alt":110,"dist":600,"from":120,"arc":-35,"pitch":-6,"zh":["大橋也成為新的觀光景點，","從漁人碼頭到八里左岸，都能看見它的身影。"],"en":["The bridge has also become a sight in its own right,","visible from Fisherman's Wharf to the Bali riverside."],"time":"2026-11-09 16:40","time1":"16:44","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.15,"base":2400},"grade":{"warm":0.9,"sat":1.14,"contrast":1.07}}},{"dur":28,"move":"orbit","at":"pylon","alt":140,"dist":900,"from":70,"arc":40,"pitch":-4,"zh":["橋塔偏向淡水一側，就是為了保住淡水的夕陽。","日落時，河口一樣金光閃閃。"],"en":["The pylon was set toward the Tamsui side to keep Tamsui's famous sunsets clear.","At sundown the river mouth still glows gold."],"time":"2026-11-09 16:55","time1":"17:00","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.15,"base":2400},"grade":{"warm":0.9,"sat":1.14,"contrast":1.07}}},{"dur":26,"move":"pull","at":"deck","alt":260,"dist0":